@format 1
@id ui-event.edit-current-lock-change
@title Edit source lock change
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Edit
@event-ref cs|PMainArea/PEditTab.cs|PEditTab|pList|PListCurrentLockChange|1
@entry input
@summary Keep the interactive crop overlay unavailable while the current Edit source is locked.
@tag source lock
@tag PEditTab
@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PEditTab
@alias inspector = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PInspector
@alias viewer = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PViewer

[input] Current Edit source lock changes <input>
- Receive the current list item's locked state through the constructor registration @ tab.PEditTab
> apply

[apply] Synchronize crop tool <process>
- Read whether the inspector crop tool is selected @ inspector.PInspectorToolCheck
- Enable the viewer crop tool only when the source is unlocked and the inspector tool is selected @ viewer.PCropToolSet
> output

[output] Crop overlay synchronized <output>
= A submitted Edit source cannot be changed through the viewer crop overlay.
! Code binding: cs|PMainArea/PEditTab.cs|PEditTab|pList|PListCurrentLockChange|1
